  - `get_sequence_plan()` — Personalizes plan based on score + phone availability
  - `run_sequence_tick()` — Cron heartbeat: checks all active sequences, fires due steps
  - `start_sequence()` — Launches new siege, immediately fires Day 0
- `eaia/api/cron.py` — Added `/cron/sequence-tick` + `/cron/start-sequence`

**Siege Engine:**
```
Day 0:  Email #1 (scored framework — challenger/pas/aida)
Day 3:  Email #2 (rotated framework for different angle)
Day 7:  Voice call via Vapi (only if score >= 70 AND phone exists)
Day 14: Email #3 (break-up / FOMO angle)
Day 21: Close sequence, mark lead as exhausted
```

**Verification:** 3 outreach tools ✅, siege engine plan generation ✅, 4 cron routes ✅

